---
/**
 * A running section marker set like a folio in a printed book. Sits in the outer
 * margin, sticks while you read, and is absent entirely on narrow screens, where
 * there is no margin for it to hang in.
 *
 * Visibility is driven by data-state so it never fights the responsive display
 * utilities: 'before' (above the first heading) and 'none' (nothing to track)
 * both fade it out; 'active' shows it.
 */
---

<aside data-folio data-state="before" aria-hidden="true" class="col-side lg:row-1 hidden lg:block">
    <div class="folio-inner sticky top-28">
    <span class="label block" data-folio-number>01</span>
    <span class="mt-2 block h-px w-8 bg-accent"></span>
    <span class="mt-2 block font-display text-lg leading-snug" data-folio-title></span>
  </div>
</aside>
